  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.3199996948242px;\">L&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda entregat la vesprada d&#39;aquest dilluns els segells de qualitat als restaurants que han participat en alguna de les tres fases de la campanya &#39;Men&uacute; Teatre, en Valenci&agrave;&#39;, l&#39;&uacute;ltima de les quals &eacute;s un curs d&#39;atenci&oacute; al p&uacute;blic, que encara est&agrave; realitzant-se.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020131.jpg\" alt=\"p1020131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020132.jpg\" alt=\"p1020132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020133.jpg\" alt=\"p1020133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020134.jpg\" alt=\"p1020134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020135.jpg\" alt=\"p1020135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020136.jpg\" alt=\"p1020136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020137.jpg\" alt=\"p1020137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyabarsirestaurantsenvalencia/p1020138.jpg\" alt=\"p1020138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25df